%N A402480 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} x^(k*(k+1)) * Product_{j=1..3*k} (1 + x^j).
%H A402480 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="/A402480/b402480.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%F A402480 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^(2*j)*(1 + x^(3*j))*(1 + x^(3*j-1))*(1 + x^(3*j-2)).
%F A402480 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / sqrt(n), where d = 3.43868429749108892564... (the same as in A402469) and c = 0.189556222511297697...
%t A402480 nmax = 100; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k*(k+1))*Product[1+x^j, {j, 1, 3*k}], {k, 1, Sqrt[nmax]}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
